<p>Knowing what it is (which I figured out in a general sense as soon as it was &quot;alternate-typeface narrator speaking to someone who is currently outside of normal space/time&quot;) instantly ratchets this one up a large number of pegs for me. The fact that we now know at least two of the bits involved&#8230;</p>

